  "releaseNotes": "TCMProject.Utilities: adds APPROVE_ABSENCE_REQUESTS (=31, \"Aprobar solicitudes de ausencia\") to PermissionEnum in TCMEnums. Grants approving or rejecting time-off requests from any worker in the company, which is what lets a shared approval inbox work: the request is not addressed to a person, so whoever holds the permission can resolve it if the usual approver is away (scheduleeasycore SCH-46). The same permission guards creating a time block directly, because blocking a schedule outright is the same authority as approving an absence. Originally released as 30 in 26.8.16.1, which collided with IMPORT_MEDICAL_HISTORY (=30) published in parallel; moved to the next free value. Non-breaking, additive.",
